        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam roundcorner 8\n\nskinparam state {\n    BackgroundColor #EBF5FB\n    BorderColor #2980B9\n    ArrowColor #1B4F72\n    StartColor #27AE60\n    EndColor #C0392B\n}\n\n[*] --&gt; SUBMITTED : Citizen submits complaint\\n[Photo attached &amp; GPS confirmed]\n\nstate SUBMITTED {\n    SUBMITTED : entry / Generate Tracking ID\n    SUBMITTED : entry / Compute Priority &amp; SLA Deadline\n    SUBMITTED : entry / Route to Department Queue\n    SUBMITTED : entry / Dispatch Citizen Confirmation\n}\n\nSUBMITTED --&gt; UNDER_REVIEW : Officer opens dossier\nSUBMITTED --&gt; REJECTED : Officer reviews\\n[Fraudulent / Out of Scope]\n\nstate UNDER_REVIEW {\n    UNDER_REVIEW : Officer evaluating validity\n    UNDER_REVIEW : Checking spatial duplicates\n}\n\nUNDER_REVIEW --&gt; REJECTED : Deemed invalid / spam\nUNDER_REVIEW --&gt; ASSIGNED : Officer assigns technician\\n[Target date &lt;= SLA deadline]\n\nstate REJECTED {\n    REJECTED : entry / Notify Citizen with reason\n    REJECTED : entry / Archive record\n}\nREJECTED --&gt; [*]\n\nstate ASSIGNED {\n    ASSIGNED : entry / Notify Field Worker\n    ASSIGNED : entry / Notify Citizen of ETA\n    ASSIGNED : do / Monitor SLA countdown timer\n}\n\nASSIGNED --&gt; IN_PROGRESS : Technician taps \&quot;Start Job\&quot;\\n[Arrived on site]\n\nstate IN_PROGRESS {\n    IN_PROGRESS : Physical repair actively ongoing\n    IN_PROGRESS : do / Calculate elapsed time vs SLA\n}\n\nIN_PROGRESS --&gt; RESOLVED : Technician uploads \&quot;After\&quot; photo\\nand taps \&quot;Submit Proof\&quot;\n\nstate RESOLVED {\n    RESOLVED : entry / Notify Citizen to verify\n    RESOLVED : entry / Start 72-hour auto-close timer\n    RESOLVED : do / Display side-by-side photo comparison\n}\n\nRESOLVED --&gt; CLOSED : Citizen clicks \&quot;Confirm\&quot;\\n[Rating &amp; Feedback submitted]\nRESOLVED --&gt; CLOSED : Timeout: 72 hours elapsed\\n[No 